CCTPBridgeModule_RemoveDomainConfig
├── when caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── when domain is not configured
│   └── it should revert with CCTPBridgeModule_DomainNotConfigured
└── given domain is configured
    ├── it should delete the domain config
    ├── it should set isValid to false
    ├── it should emit DomainConfigRemoved
    ├── it should not affect other configured domains
    ├── it should allow reconfiguring the removed domain
    ├── when removing the same domain twice
    │   └── it should revert on second removal with DomainNotConfigured
    └── when executing after domain removal
        └── it should return failed result with "Domain not configured"
